### 3. Routes

#### [NEW] Routes in [routes/web.php](file:///Users/ahmedmosaad/Herd/myclass2026-main/routes/web.php)

```php
// Teacher Grading Routes
Route::prefix('qu/teacher')->middleware(['auth'])->group(function () {
    Route::get('grading', [QuExamController::class, 'teacherGradingIndex'])
        ->name('qu-teacher.grading.index');
    
    Route::get('grading/{attempt}', [QuExamController::class, 'teacherGradeAttempt'])
        ->name('qu-teacher.grading.show');
    
    Route::post('grading/{attempt}', [QuExamController::class, 'saveGrades'])
        ->name('qu-teacher.grading.save');
    
    // Analytics Routes
    Route::get('analytics', [QuExamController::class, 'analyticsIndex'])
        ->name('qu-teacher.analytics.index');
    
    Route::get('analytics/{exam}', [QuExamController::class, 'examAnalytics'])
        ->name('qu-teacher.analytics.exam');
    
    // Export Routes
    Route::get('export/{exam}/{format}', [QuExamController::class, 'exportResults'])
        ->name('qu-teacher.export');
});
```

