## Implementation Order

1. **Database Migration** (5 min)
   - Add grading columns to `qu_attempt_answers` and `qu_attempts`

2. **Backend Models** (15 min)
   - Add methods to [QuAttempt](file:///Users/ahmedmosaad/Herd/myclass2026-main/app/Models/QuAttempt.php#7-49) and `QuAttemptAnswer`

3. **Backend Controller** (45 min)
   - Implement grading methods
   - Implement analytics methods
   - Implement export methods

4. **Frontend - Grading Interface** (60 min)
   - Create `QuGrading.vue`
   - Implement grading form
   - Add navigation between students

5. **Frontend - Analytics Dashboard** (60 min)
   - Create `QuAnalyticsDashboard.vue`
   - Implement charts
   - Add detailed analytics view

6. **Export Functionality** (30 min)
   - Install dependencies
   - Create export classes
   - Add export buttons to UI

7. **Testing** (30 min)
   - Manual testing of all features
   - Fix bugs

**Total Estimated Time**: ~4 hours

